      "text": "- 5 souls from coffers\nto place 1 imp.\n- Each time anyone\npromotes outside of\nGehenna, take 1 soul\nfrom coffers to\nreserves.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 5 souls from coffers to place 1 imp.\n- Each time anyone promotes outside of Gehenna, take 1 soul from coffers to reserves.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hJsuPYMdFCMMjPvf6Y6iH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -899.3395900849031,
      "y": 580.705165912315,
      "width": 219.0902513435284,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0.006465405833138149,
