      "text": "- 3 souls from coffers to\nset the combat order.\n- 2 souls from coffers to\nmove the sigil of wrath.\n- 3 souls from coffers to\ndiscard 1 agent from\nwarfare contracting track.\n- Each time an imp is\ndestroyed, take 1 soul from\ncoffers to reserves.",
